            "detailed_description": "Are you after a <strong>new VR experience</strong>?<br><br>Something that tests your skills without leaving you sweating in fear?<br><br>Then try Hand Eye Cubination, the first third person VR platformer on Steam!<br><br>You heard that right, third person! Platformer!<br><br>But how you ask? Why? What even?<br><br>Simply put, you control two cubes through the direction your hands are pointing.<br><br>Your goal is to guide your cubes through a maze of challenges!<br><br>Did I mention you can't see your hands? Because that's a pretty important feature.<br><br>You have to rely 100% on your human senses to successfully navigate through the world!<br><br>Come give it a crack and put your hand eye coordination to the test!<br><br>Hand Eye Cubination!",
            "about_the_game": "Are you after a <strong>new VR experience</strong>?<br><br>Something that tests your skills without leaving you sweating in fear?<br><br>Then try Hand Eye Cubination, the first third person VR platformer on Steam!<br><br>You heard that right, third person! Platformer!<br><br>But how you ask? Why? What even?<br><br>Simply put, you control two cubes through the direction your hands are pointing.<br><br>Your goal is to guide your cubes through a maze of challenges!<br><br>Did I mention you can't see your hands? Because that's a pretty important feature.<br><br>You have to rely 100% on your human senses to successfully navigate through the world!<br><br>Come give it a crack and put your hand eye coordination to the test!<br><br>Hand Eye Cubination!",
            "short_description": "Are you after a new VR experience?Come try Hand Eye Cubination!Your job is to guide two cubes through a series of challenging levels with nothing more than your perception of where your flailing limbs are pointing!With no visual clues to assist, you will rely 100% on your human senses to get you through!Check out the store for more info!",
